# VitePress
.vitepress/cache/
.vitepress/dist/
# O conteudo do site e gerado, mas a config precisa ser versionada: sem ela o
# vitepress usa o target antigo do Vite e o build quebra no esbuild 0.28,
# derrubando o job de release inteiro. Ver task-045.
packages/docs/content/*
!packages/docs/content/.vitepress
packages/docs/content/.vitepress/*
!packages/docs/content/.vitepress/config.mts

# OS
Thumbs.db

*storybook.log
storybook-static
